1
00:00:01,460 --> 00:00:02,290
No.

2
00:00:02,560 --> 00:00:03,820
Why'd it reignite?

3
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:05,729
Something has to be wrong.

4
00:00:05,940 --> 00:00:08,400
You're the one who reignited the flame.

5
00:00:09,620 --> 00:00:10,450
Bastardo!

6
00:00:10,533 --> 00:00:12,441
You've messed with the wrong guy!

7
00:00:15,120 --> 00:00:15,950
No.

8
00:00:16,060 --> 00:00:17,660
This is not the one.

9
00:00:17,920 --> 00:00:20,273
This soul does not belong to the chosen.

10
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:22,206
What's that supposed to mean?

11
00:00:25,120 --> 00:00:27,180
Hey. Hey. Old man.

12
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,860
There's not a single wound
on him, but he's dead

13
00:00:44,280 --> 00:00:47,677
You two have reignited the flame salvation

14
00:00:47,760 --> 00:00:51,880
awaits repair as before you lie too fast

15
00:00:55,900 --> 00:00:59,312
So he attacks anyone who sees
the lighter being reignited!

16
00:01:10,960 --> 00:01:11,980
What the hell?

17
00:01:12,380 --> 00:01:14,615
This freak just came out of my shadow!

18
00:01:14,700 --> 00:01:17,288
This must be how he's
gonna rip out my soul!

19
00:01:30,900 --> 00:01:33,700
Thank you.

20
00:02:05,680 --> 00:02:08,417
I'll see you

21
00:02:08,500 --> 00:02:13,080
next time.

22
00:02:23,340 --> 00:02:25,880
When you shine, you will shine

23
00:02:26,400 --> 00:02:33,177
You will shine for your life
You won't be able to shine You

24
00:02:33,260 --> 00:02:36,860
will continue to fight You
will be the people of the world

25
00:02:41,420 --> 00:02:44,000
Fighting God!

26
00:02:52,340 --> 00:02:56,060
Will you live and become one
of the chosen? It's no use.

27
00:02:56,260 --> 00:02:58,613
The sky's way stronger than golden wind.

28
00:02:58,760 --> 00:03:01,760
The old man died after the
arrow impaled his soul.

29
00:03:02,080 --> 00:03:03,139
But what about me?

30
00:03:03,360 --> 00:03:05,595
What'll happen if he pierces my stand?

31
00:03:05,820 --> 00:03:08,200
Or is it your destiny to perish?

32
00:03:13,980 --> 00:03:15,380
What's with this arrow?

33
00:03:15,760 --> 00:03:18,657
If he drives that thing through
me, there's no way I'll survive.

34
00:03:18,740 --> 00:03:19,570
Yeah!

35
00:03:20,880 --> 00:03:22,233
Guess I have no choice!

36
00:03:22,560 --> 00:03:25,266
I don't really give a
damn if Polpo is a capo.

37
00:03:25,440 --> 00:03:28,377
If that bloated bedroll
thinks he can derail my dreams

38
00:03:28,460 --> 00:03:31,636
and murder innocent bystanders
like that nice old man,

39
00:03:31,940 --> 00:03:33,999
then he'll have to die by my hands!

40
00:03:44,300 --> 00:03:48,780
Now my Stan Golden Wind will
set your senses on fire,

41
00:03:49,020 --> 00:03:51,240
sending you into a slow-motion haze.

42
00:03:56,620 --> 00:03:57,450
What?

43
00:03:57,640 --> 00:03:58,520
He's gone!

44
00:03:58,840 --> 00:04:01,357
But he should have zero
motor control right now.

45
00:04:01,440 --> 00:04:04,660
At the very most, he should
only be able to crawl.

46
00:04:05,280 --> 00:04:06,692
How'd he just disappear?

47
00:04:09,160 --> 00:04:10,640
He has to be nearby.

48
00:04:11,400 --> 00:04:12,580
He's gotta be.

49
00:04:15,240 --> 00:04:17,652
Golden Wind's ability won't last forever.

50
00:04:17,920 --> 00:04:20,520
If he breaks free, I'm done for.

51
00:04:31,440 --> 00:04:32,270
What?

52
00:04:32,353 --> 00:04:34,400
What's going on? Merda!

53
00:04:34,680 --> 00:04:36,386
He was hiding in the shadows!

54
00:04:36,560 --> 00:04:39,820
He's definitely slower,
but as powerful as before!

55
00:04:40,160 --> 00:04:41,820
And I can't move a muscle!

56
00:04:42,680 --> 00:04:43,510
Ah!

57
00:05:11,740 --> 00:05:17,177
that's it he's been using the shadows he
can move from shadow to shadow traveling

58
00:05:17,260 --> 00:05:22,437
at lightning speed but he shouldn't be
able to touch me here in the sunlight

59
00:05:22,520 --> 00:05:27,777
still the sun will disappear behind
the school in a matter of minutes once

60
00:05:27,860 --> 00:05:33,220
that happens i'm screwed but then again
If I can drag him into the sunlight,

61
00:05:33,440 --> 00:05:35,057
there might be something I can do.

62
00:05:35,140 --> 00:05:36,728
It's worth a shot at least.

63
00:05:36,980 --> 00:05:40,060
Question is, how do I draw him out? Think.

64
00:05:40,540 --> 00:05:42,187
He's waiting for you to act.

65
00:05:42,420 --> 00:05:43,832
That's all he has to do.

66
00:05:43,960 --> 00:05:47,195
Wait and watch the sunset
with that creepy grin of his.

67
00:05:48,840 --> 00:05:49,670
Giorno!

68
00:05:49,753 --> 00:05:50,660
Is that you down there?

69
00:05:50,840 --> 00:05:52,017
The heck are you doing?

70
00:05:52,100 --> 00:05:53,340
Koichi? Out with it!

71
00:05:53,540 --> 00:05:56,037
Why is there a dead man at
the bottom of the stairs?

72
00:05:56,120 --> 00:05:57,917
What the hell did you do to him?

73
00:05:58,000 --> 00:05:59,177
You've got it all wrong.

74
00:05:59,260 --> 00:06:00,217
I'm innocent, I swear.

75
00:06:00,300 --> 00:06:02,359
That stand right there attack, huh?

76
00:06:02,460 --> 00:06:03,937
You're telling me I'm wrong?

77
00:06:04,020 --> 00:06:05,491
I know I saw you, Giorno!

78
00:06:05,640 --> 00:06:07,297
You were talking to that old man!

79
00:06:07,380 --> 00:06:10,145
I was watching the whole
thing from the window!

80
00:06:10,700 --> 00:06:11,800
Really? So then...

81
00:06:13,560 --> 00:06:15,972
Koichi, did you see the lighter reignite?

82
00:06:16,940 --> 00:06:19,337
You can't step into the handrail's shadow!

83
00:06:19,420 --> 00:06:21,538
If you do, Koichi, you'll be killed!

84
00:06:22,640 --> 00:06:24,040
Oh no, he got him!

85
00:06:24,200 --> 00:06:28,457
You saw the re-ignition of the
lighter before you light two paths!

86
00:06:28,540 --> 00:06:33,480
Do you ever become one of the Chosen,
or is it your destiny to perish?

87
00:06:33,800 --> 00:06:34,897
This arrow is...

88
00:06:34,980 --> 00:06:36,620
Interceptive Golden Wind!

89
00:06:41,100 --> 00:06:42,880
Talk about searing Bane.

90
00:06:43,080 --> 00:06:44,600
That hurt like all hell,

91
00:06:44,780 --> 00:06:48,604
but at least now I'm able to give
you a healthy dose of sunshine.

92
00:06:59,960 --> 00:07:01,320
It serves you right!

93
00:07:01,660 --> 00:07:04,189
I turned the handrail
into morning glories.

94
00:07:04,280 --> 00:07:06,280
So much for hiding in the shadows.

95
00:07:11,340 --> 00:07:12,170
Damn it!

96
00:07:12,320 --> 00:07:14,144
There were more shadows nearby.

97
00:07:15,120 --> 00:07:17,917
If I can just pull him
into the complete sunlight,

98
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:20,294
I have a chance at offing him for good.

99
00:07:21,340 --> 00:07:22,257
What the hell?

100
00:07:22,340 --> 00:07:24,860
What was that stand? Didn't you see?

101
00:07:25,020 --> 00:07:26,138
The murdering kind.

102
00:07:26,560 --> 00:07:29,442
It killed the old man
after he relit the lighter.

103
00:07:29,580 --> 00:07:31,286
We happened to see him do it.

104
00:07:31,900 --> 00:07:34,777
So now the damn thing has made
targets out of the two of us.

105
00:07:34,860 --> 00:07:35,897
That's not what I mean.

106
00:07:35,980 --> 00:07:36,810
That arrow.

107
00:07:37,520 --> 00:07:39,557
I'm sure it's from the bow and arrow.

108
00:07:39,640 --> 00:07:41,346
To think there'd be one here.

109
00:07:41,760 --> 00:07:43,977
Just what in the world
have you been getting into?

110
00:07:44,060 --> 00:07:48,472
What did you do to make this arrow-wielding
stand come out of the woodwork?

111
00:07:50,500 --> 00:07:52,324
It'll take too long to explain.

112
00:07:52,740 --> 00:07:54,916
And really, you know as much as I do.

113
00:07:55,600 --> 00:07:57,129
What do you know about it?

114
00:07:57,380 --> 00:08:00,657
Tell me everything, and don't leave
out the stuff about the arrow.

115
00:08:00,740 --> 00:08:02,277
Why did you save me just now?

116
00:08:02,360 --> 00:08:03,190
Forget that!

117
00:08:03,273 --> 00:08:04,437
I need to know more about the arrow!

118
00:08:04,520 --> 00:08:05,477
The sun is setting!

119
00:08:05,560 --> 00:08:07,057
Tell me why you saved my life!

120
00:08:07,140 --> 00:08:11,140
Don't think for one second I would
ever feel indebted to some thief!

121
00:08:13,720 --> 00:08:16,955
The lighter was ignited
because of my careless actions.

122
00:08:17,200 --> 00:08:19,788
The old man just got
caught up in this mess.

123
00:08:20,100 --> 00:08:21,865
The whole thing makes me sick.

124
00:08:22,800 --> 00:08:27,300
I believe in what I set out to do, but
that doesn't make it hurt any less.

125
00:08:28,420 --> 00:08:30,580
It's terrible, but I can't stop now.

126
00:08:31,280 --> 00:08:35,868
There's a dream burning in my heart, and
I'm seeing it through no matter what.

127
00:08:40,920 --> 00:08:44,920
Two years back, I was
wounded with a similar arrow.

128
00:08:45,380 --> 00:08:47,027
It's what awakened my stand.

129
00:08:47,740 --> 00:08:51,152
If the power doesn't awaken,
the victim is killed instead.

130
00:08:53,380 --> 00:08:54,498
Awaken the ability?

131
00:08:54,840 --> 00:08:55,670
Of course.

132
00:08:55,753 --> 00:08:56,860
One of the chosen.

133
00:08:57,180 --> 00:08:58,037
That's what it meant.

134
00:08:58,120 --> 00:09:01,300
The chosen are those whose
stands have awakened.

135
00:09:01,660 --> 00:09:03,719
That must be what Polpo is testing.

136
00:09:04,680 --> 00:09:06,386
I'm not sure about the arrow,

137
00:09:06,580 --> 00:09:11,286
and I have no idea where it came from,
but I've faced this kind of stand before.

138
00:09:11,680 --> 00:09:14,420
It's self-piloting in
long range. It's deadly.

139
00:09:15,020 --> 00:09:16,600
Well, that's terrifying.

140
00:09:16,960 --> 00:09:19,217
Thankfully, it's limited
to just simple attacks,

141
00:09:19,300 --> 00:09:22,241
but it won't give up until
it destroys its target.

142
00:09:22,420 --> 00:09:25,820
Our best strategy is to find
the user and take him down!

143
00:09:26,280 --> 00:09:28,620
As much as I would like to, we can't.

144
00:09:29,120 --> 00:09:32,680
He's safely behind
bars, out of reach. Huh?

145
00:09:33,460 --> 00:09:34,290
Either way,

146
00:09:34,480 --> 00:09:36,737
he's stuck hiding in the
school's shadow for now,

147
00:09:36,820 --> 00:09:39,997
so we need to get to the side
facing the sun while we can.

148
00:09:40,080 --> 00:09:42,960
Then, before the sun sets completely,

149
00:09:43,440 --> 00:09:45,677
we'll lure him into the
shadow of some moving object

150
00:09:45,760 --> 00:09:48,584
before ripping it away
when he least expects it.

151
00:09:48,720 --> 00:09:52,132
He'll get totally whammied and
not even know what hit him.

152
00:09:52,220 --> 00:09:53,050
Got it!

153
00:10:07,200 --> 00:10:08,080
He's gone!

154
00:10:13,100 --> 00:10:13,930
What?

155
00:10:14,013 --> 00:10:14,843
Where did you...

156
00:10:17,000 --> 00:10:19,220
You witnessed the re-ignition.

157
00:10:20,060 --> 00:10:21,060
The crows.

158
00:10:21,260 --> 00:10:25,436
He snuck out of the school's shadow
and hit in the shadow of the crows.

159
00:10:26,080 --> 00:10:27,200
This bastardo.

160
00:10:32,740 --> 00:10:33,570
Merida!

161
00:10:34,180 --> 00:10:37,592
He's faster and stronger when
he's surrounded by darkness.

162
00:10:38,040 --> 00:10:39,877
Go, act three, three, three!

163
00:10:39,960 --> 00:10:40,790
Please!

164
00:10:42,300 --> 00:10:44,820
My Reverb Act Three can weigh down stance.

165
00:10:45,160 --> 00:10:47,748
It can do the same to
ordinary objects, too.

166
00:10:47,880 --> 00:10:49,797
The target's hands have been subdued.

167
00:10:49,880 --> 00:10:53,056
Consider him super glued to
the ground, Master Koichi.

168
00:10:57,480 --> 00:10:59,362
He shouldn't be able to hang on!

169
00:10:59,640 --> 00:11:02,457
I applied pressure to every
centimeter of his hands!

170
00:11:02,540 --> 00:11:05,397
This force should make bending
his fingers impossible!

171
00:11:05,480 --> 00:11:06,597
He's too strong!

172
00:11:06,680 --> 00:11:09,580
Nice try, but this
bastardo's not gonna let go.

173
00:11:09,940 --> 00:11:12,780
Once more, before you lie to pass.

174
00:11:13,620 --> 00:11:14,740
It's no use!

175
00:11:14,920 --> 00:11:18,337
When a stance suffers damage, the
same injuries are felt by the user!

176
00:11:18,420 --> 00:11:21,420
At this rate, he's going
to shatter Giorno's bones!

177
00:11:21,580 --> 00:11:24,300
Act three, release three freezes now! No.

178
00:11:24,600 --> 00:11:26,659
I'd prefer that you didn't, Koichi.

179
00:11:27,560 --> 00:11:28,480
You heard me.

180
00:11:28,700 --> 00:11:31,017
Don't even think about
releasing your ability.

181
00:11:31,100 --> 00:11:32,512
It's just what I needed.

182
00:11:33,200 --> 00:11:34,657
Nice going, Mr. Tourist.

183
00:11:34,740 --> 00:11:36,597
You couldn't have done me a bigger favor.

184
00:11:36,680 --> 00:11:37,510
Look out!

185
00:11:37,593 --> 00:11:39,008
He's gonna crush your legs!

186
00:11:44,220 --> 00:11:45,280
Holy crap!

187
00:11:45,720 --> 00:11:46,700
That tree!

188
00:11:47,040 --> 00:11:51,120
Golden Wind can continuously inject
life force into any organism.

189
00:11:51,480 --> 00:11:55,317
I accelerated its growth to progress
through its entire life cycle,

190
00:11:55,400 --> 00:11:57,047
and now it's withering away.

191
00:11:57,380 --> 00:11:58,439
That's your power?

192
00:11:58,740 --> 00:12:00,740
But the tree's ten meters away!

193
00:12:00,900 --> 00:12:01,880
How did you...

194
00:12:03,340 --> 00:12:04,170
Whoa!

195
00:12:04,280 --> 00:12:06,398
You dug a hole and struck the roots!

196
00:12:16,320 --> 00:12:17,620
Wow, you did it!

197
00:12:17,780 --> 00:12:19,309
The shadow's totally gone!

198
00:12:19,540 --> 00:12:22,069
We dragged that creeper
right into the sun!

199
00:12:29,900 --> 00:12:32,760
You were rattling on
about my having two paths,

200
00:12:33,040 --> 00:12:36,275
but there's only one path
that's lying in wait for you.

201
00:12:36,680 --> 00:12:40,637
Sorry to bother, Koichi, but could I
ask you to step to the right for me?

202
00:12:40,720 --> 00:12:42,120
Oh, uh, sure.

203
00:12:51,400 --> 00:12:54,100
Now bask in that southern Italian sun.

204
00:12:54,580 --> 00:12:57,000
Like I said, just one path.

205
00:12:57,380 --> 00:12:59,060
Enjoy the ride, stronzo.

206
00:13:12,700 --> 00:13:16,280
But I wonder, was that enough
to get me into the Familia?

207
00:13:17,180 --> 00:13:18,140
Guess we'll see.

208
00:13:28,300 --> 00:13:29,220
That arrow!

209
00:13:29,700 --> 00:13:31,957
Its existence in Italy
only means that more

210
00:13:32,040 --> 00:13:34,717
innocent people are going
to end up being killed!

211
00:13:34,800 --> 00:13:37,094
I've got to let Jotaro know everything!

212
00:13:39,700 --> 00:13:42,200
Hey, what do you think you're doing? You.

213
00:13:42,560 --> 00:13:44,325
You mentioned there were more.

214
00:13:44,820 --> 00:13:46,580
I destroyed Polpo's stand.

215
00:13:46,800 --> 00:13:48,565
You saw it with your own eyes.

216
00:13:48,660 --> 00:13:49,957
Is that what you think?

217
00:13:50,040 --> 00:13:51,628
You couldn't be more wrong!

218
00:13:52,200 --> 00:13:53,030
Look,

219
00:13:53,113 --> 00:13:54,277
I'll admit things would have been a lot

220
00:13:54,360 --> 00:13:56,357
worse if you hadn't
taken care of that stand.

221
00:13:56,440 --> 00:13:58,377
But don't let yourself be fooled.

222
00:13:58,460 --> 00:14:00,837
The sun only stopped the
stand from attacking.

223
00:14:00,920 --> 00:14:03,077
Wherever he is, the user's perfectly fine.

224
00:14:03,160 --> 00:14:04,880
He's alive? Really?

225
00:14:05,680 --> 00:14:06,621
Most definitely.

226
00:14:07,360 --> 00:14:11,537
Long-range stands like we just fought
have almost no effect on their users.

227
00:14:11,620 --> 00:14:15,920
He probably has no idea that this
fight even took place. Say what?

228
00:14:16,660 --> 00:14:18,460
So he's completely oblivious?

229
00:14:18,940 --> 00:14:21,234
Do you think he knows I'm a stand user?

230
00:14:21,360 --> 00:14:22,419
You're relentless.

231
00:14:22,620 --> 00:14:26,617
If he felt anything, it was maybe just
an unusual heaviness in his hands.

232
00:14:26,700 --> 00:14:28,517
But there'd be no way
that he could learn that

233
00:14:28,600 --> 00:14:31,365
you and I are stand users
just from that fight.

234
00:14:32,740 --> 00:14:36,377
hey i'd really appreciate it if
you'd move your hand now sorry

235
00:14:36,460 --> 00:14:41,797
but that's a call i just can't
allow you to make it's not one guy

236
00:14:41,880 --> 00:14:47,857
it's an organization a big one
if you call in backup word could

237
00:14:47,940 --> 00:14:51,297
get out to the enemy enemy organization

238
00:14:51,380 --> 00:14:54,980
this stays between us koichi

239
00:15:12,840 --> 00:15:15,880
I was about to dig into
this luscious donation.

240
00:15:36,320 --> 00:15:39,120
I can't seem to recall where we left off.

241
00:15:39,300 --> 00:15:40,660
Who are you again, boy?

242
00:15:42,480 --> 00:15:45,997
That's right, you're a Giorno, uh...

243
00:15:46,080 --> 00:15:47,800
It's Giorno Giovanna.

244
00:15:48,040 --> 00:15:50,000
Of course, my apologies.

245
00:15:51,300 --> 00:15:55,380
My mind is always going elsewhere
when I'm having a snack.

246
00:15:56,620 --> 00:15:58,860
All the blood goes to the stomach.

247
00:16:02,020 --> 00:16:05,460
If I may be so bold, Giorno,
are you a man of God?

248
00:16:10,680 --> 00:16:13,386
Well, I'm not devout,
if that's what you mean.

249
00:16:14,920 --> 00:16:16,620
That may be for the best,

250
00:16:16,780 --> 00:16:20,604
for what I'm about to say to you
runs counter to the word of God.

251
00:16:21,060 --> 00:16:23,531
But I ask that you take our chat to heart.

252
00:16:23,860 --> 00:16:26,817
If having faith in one's
fellow man is paramount,

253
00:16:26,900 --> 00:16:29,557
then it must also be true
that there's no greater

254
00:16:29,640 --> 00:16:32,640
offense to a fellow man
than the act of disrespect.

255
00:16:33,040 --> 00:16:34,280
Listen carefully.

256
00:16:35,300 --> 00:16:37,420
Abusing that trust is unacceptable.

257
